## 🔥 `as const` & `typeof` — Tumhe Jo Dikkat Aayi Thi

### `as const` kya karta hai?
```typescript
// Bina as const:
const roles = ["customer", "admin"];
// Type: string[]  (Koi bhi string daal do)
roles.push("hacker");  // ✅ Allowed! (Unsafe)

// Saath as const:
const roles = ["customer", "admin"] as const;
// Type: readonly ["customer", "admin"]  (Locked!)
roles.push("hacker");  // ❌ ERROR! (Safe)
```

### `typeof arr[number]` kya karta hai?
```typescript
const allowedRoles = ["customer", "admin", "seller"] as const;

// Step 1: typeof allowedRoles
// → readonly ["customer", "admin", "seller"]

// Step 2: [number] → "Koi bhi index pe kya mil sakta hai?"
// Index 0 → "customer", Index 1 → "admin", Index 2 → "seller"

// Step 3: Sab combine (Union)
type Role = (typeof allowedRoles)[number];
// → "customer" | "admin" | "seller"

// Fayda: Ek jagah change karo, type auto-update!
```

